    {
      "type": "h2",
      "text": "Propel"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Propel Treatment provides innovative devices and procedures to shift teeth much quicker than ordinary treatment. Dr. Gonzales can use Propel in combination with current orthodontic treatments, including Invisalign and traditional metal braces, to help move teeth into their desired position up to 50% faster than teeth can move with Invisalign and traditional metal braces alone."
    },
    {
      "type": "h2",
      "text": "5-STAR-RATED ORTHODONTIST IN"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "DUBLIN & TRACY CALIFORNIA (CA), FOR BRACES & INVISALIGN"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Dr. Gonzales and his staff are truly outstanding. They have an excellent manner with children, while being extremely competent and professional. I would feel comfortable recommending their services to anyone."
    },
    {
      "type": "h4",
      "text": "George C"
    },
    {
      "type": "img",
      "src": "assets/img/star.png",
      "alt": "",
      "title": null
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "We are extremely pleased with Dr. Gonzales and his wonderful staff. He and his staff are patient and understanding and they make my son feel completely at ease. They make every visit stress-free and fun for siblings who have to wait in the waiting room too! *thumbs up* Thank you!!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "h4",
      "text": "Betty W"
    },
    {
